## DON'T

- ❌ Production edit without contract brief (behavior change)
- ❌ Multi-purpose PRs
- ❌ Domain I/O in `domain/`; concrete adapters in `application/`
- ❌ Business policy in adapters or fat views
- ❌ Claim pass without running gates
- ❌ Leading-underscore-only renames ([`shapez2-core.mdc`](mdc:.cursor/rules/shapez2-core.mdc) Forbidden Shortcuts)
- ❌ Revive deleted/superseded specs as authority

